   _atom_site_adp_type
   _atom_site_U_iso_or_equiv
   _atom_site_site_symmetry_multiplicity
Er1    Er   0.30000     0.80000     0.60000     1.0000     Uiso 0.0030     4
Ge1    Ge   0.00000     0.00000     0.00000     1.0000     Uiso 0.0030     2
Be1    Be   0.12500     0.62500     0.87500     1.0000     Uiso 0.0030     4
