O2     O    0.20000     0.70000     0.30000     1.0000     Uiso 0.0030     4
O3     O    0.10000     0.87500     0.75000     1.0000     Uiso 0.0030     8

loop_  _atom_type_symbol _atom_type_number_in_cell
  Be      4
